==Alemannic German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{i|particle; preposition}} {{alter|gsw|ga|ge|gi|gu}}; {{alter|gsw|gan|gon}}
* {{i|verb}} {{l-lite|gsw|ga|gā}}, {{l-lite|gsw|gan|gān}}, {{alter|gsw|ga|gaa|gah|gan|ge|gi|goo|goh|gou|gu}}

===Etymology 1===
Short form of {{m-lite|gsw|gon||to, towards}}. Particle served originally as a preposition (prespositions {{m-lite|gsw|gon}}, {{m-lite|gsw|gan}} still do). Cognate to (particle/preposition) {{cog-lite|gsw|ga}}, {{m-lite|gsw|ge}}, {{m-lite|gsw|gi}}, {{m-lite|gsw|gu}}, etc. From {{inh-lite|gsw|gmh|gon}} ({{m-lite|gmh|gan}}, {{m-lite|gmh|gen}}), from {{der-lite|gsw|goh|gagan}}, from {{der|gsw|gem-pro|*gagin}}. Cognate to {{cog-lite|de|gen||to, towards}}, {{m-lite|de|gegen||against, towards}}, {{cog-lite|nl|tegen}}, {{cog-lite|en|gain}}, {{m-lite|en|gain-}}, {{m-lite|en|again}}, {{m-lite|en|against}}, {{cog-lite|is|gegn}}.

Not to be confused with the verb {{l-lite|gsw|go||to go}} ({{l-lite|gsw|gaa}}, {{l-lite|gsw|goo}}, etc.).

====Pronunciation====
* {{a|Swiss}} {{IPA-lite|gsw|[ɡo]|[ɡɔ]}}
* {{hyph-lite|gsw|go}}

====Particle====
{{head-lite|gsw|particles}}

# [[to]] {{i|particle follows after verbs (such as go, come); placed before [[infinitive]]}}
#: {{syn-lite|gsw|cho|lah|q=in northern and western Switzerland dialects with certain verbs}}
#: {{ux-lite|inline=1|gsw|I(ch) gang '''go''' ''({{l-lite|gsw|ga}}, {{l-lite|gsw|ge}}, {{l-lite|gsw|gi}}, {{l-lite|gsw|gu}})'' schaffe.|I am going '''[[to]]''' work.}}
#: {{ux-lite|inline=1|gsw|I(ch) gahn(e) '''go''' schaffe.|I'm going '''[[to]]''' work.}}
#: {{ux-lite|inline=1|gsw|I(ch) gang '''go''' schlaaffe.|I am going '''[[to]]''' sleep.}}

====Preposition====
{{head-lite|gsw|prepositions}}

# {{lb|gsw|dated}} [[to]], [[towards]] {{i|indicating a direction; nowaday often replaced by {{l-lite|gsw|uf}}, {{l-lite|gsw|nach}}}}
#: {{syn-lite|gsw|uf|nach}}
#: {{ux-lite|inline=1|gsw|I(ch) gang '''go''' ''(ga, gi, etc.)'' Bäärn.|I'm going '''[[to]]''' Bern.}}
#: {{ux-lite|inline=1|gsw|I(ch) gang '''go''' ''(ga, gi, etc.)'' Züri.|I'm going '''[[to]]''' Zurich.}}
